---
description: Keep Narration Studio harness-centric. Tools own I/O; do not hardcode segment counts.
globs: src/NarrationStudio/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

# Narration Studio harness

- Change `ProductionTools` and `PipelineStore` before agent prompts.
- Interpolate `StudioOptions` (`SegmentCount`, `MaxSlidesPerSegment`, `TargetTalkMinutes`) instead of hardcoding 8 / 5 / 7.
- Do not add file-write methods on agents. New pipeline stages are new tool methods.
- After a run, `HarnessChecks` must be able to fail the process if artifacts are missing.
